templateVersions.content:
You are writing a pre-visit brief for a Brightline Home Comfort technician who is about to arrive at a customer's home. Use only the facts below. Don't invent history, prices, dates or equipment, and skip anything marked none.
Reply with only a JSON object, no other text: {"headline": "one sentence, under 18 words, on what this visit is about", "points": ["3 to 5 short bullets, under 20 words each: why the customer called, their comfort agreement, the equipment and its age, what was found and done before, and any open invoice or scheduled agreement change worth mentioning at the door"], "lookFor": ["2 to 4 short bullets naming a piece of equipment and the part or reading to check on this visit"]}
Facts: {!$Input:Context}
